[00:00.38]1. Bless us as we meet together,
[00:06.60]O Jehovah, we now pray.
[00:12.82]We are thankful for our meetings;
[00:19.10]May your spirit with us stay.
[00:35.58]2. Help us, Lord, refine our worship;
[00:41.58]With your Word, oh, do us fill.
[00:46.27]Train our minds and tongues to witness;
[00:53.77]Love within our hearts instill.
[01:11.23]3. Loving Father, bless our meetings;
[01:17.44]Grant us peace and unity.
[01:23.65]May our words and may our actions
[01:28.65]Magnify your Sov’reignty.